# Anchorline needs no environment variables. The app, the demo and every
# test run without accounts, API keys or paid services.
#
# Future optional integrations (live transport data, a hosted model that
# proposes changes) must keep their credentials on a server you control.
# Never put a provider key in a VITE_* variable: Vite inlines those into the
# browser bundle, where anyone can read them.
#
# Example of a server-side placeholder for a future adapter (unused today):
# TRANSPORT_PROVIDER_API_KEY=replace-me
